@node Announce
@chapter Manual Provenance And Contributions

This manual began as the second-edition Emacspeak user manual and still
contains selected chapters from that project.  Emacsvox-specific operating
guidance, names, requirements, and generated command reference are maintained
in this repository.  Historical chapters retain Emacspeak terminology where
that identity and period context matter.

